@VexorionERP_HostAddress = https://localhost:7171
@TenantCode = demo
@UserNameOrEmail = admin
@Password = DemoAdmin123!
@AccessToken = paste-access-token-here

### Login
POST {{VexorionERP_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"tenantCode": "{{TenantCode}}",
	"userNameOrEmail": "{{UserNameOrEmail}}",
	"password": "{{Password}}"
}

### Current user
GET {{VexorionERP_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Products
GET {{VexorionERP_HostAddress}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Create product
POST {{VexorionERP_HostAddress}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "Demo Product",
	"sku": "DEMO-001",
	"description": "Sample product created from the HTTP file",
	"unitPrice": 19.99,
	"isActive": true
}

### Inventory balances
GET {{VexorionERP_HostAddress}}/api/inventory-balances
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Inventory valuation (current standard cost)
GET {{VexorionERP_HostAddress}}/api/inventory-reports/valuation
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Inventory movement audit
GET {{VexorionERP_HostAddress}}/api/inventory-reports/movement-audit?startDate=2026-10-01&endDate=2026-10-31&skip=0&take=100
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Inventory reorder recommendations
GET {{VexorionERP_HostAddress}}/api/inventory-reports/reorder-recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
